e|S1E04}}\n\nDante cast an orange Armorbrand to protect himself from [[Klaus]]' [[Poisonfang]] attack. {{Source|S1E17}}\n\n[[Unnamed Suit 053]] cast the spell over [[Hoffman]] in [[Tower of Nostradamus]] to protect him from the attacks of [[Melee Artist]]. {{Source|S2E28}}\n{{clear}}","text":"Dante cast a silent orange Armorbrand outside his house against Unnamed Suit 001's Augerfrost. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nZhalia used an indigo version of the spell during the battle against the Organization in the Cave of the Gargoyle. [S1E04]\n\nDante cast an orange Armorbrand to protect himself from Klaus' Poisonfang attack. [S1E17]\n\nUnnamed Suit 053 cast the spell over Hoffman in Tower of Nostradamus to protect him from the attacks of Melee Artist. [S2E28]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:S1E01 Dante Armorbrand.png|Dante silently casts an orange Armorbrand\nFile:S1E25 Zhalia Cherit Armorbrand.png|Zhalia uses Armorbrand\nFile:S2E28 Hoffman Armorbrand Melee Artist Billie.jpg|Armorbrand protects [[Hoffman]] from [[Melee Artist]]\nFile:S2E45 Tersly Armorbrand.png|[[Tersly]] uses Armorbrand\n</gallery>","text":"File:S1E01 Dante Armorbrand.png|Dante silently casts an orange Armorbrand\nFile:S1E25 Zhalia Cherit Armorbrand.png|Zhalia uses Armorbrand\nFile:S2E28 Hoffman Armorbrand Melee Artist Billie.jpg|Armorbrand protects Hoffman from Melee Artist\nFile:S2E45 Tersly Armorbrand.png|Tersly uses Armorbrand"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR=Marque-armure\n|DUT=Vuurharnas”  “Spiegelschild\n|POR=Armadura\n}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Armorbrand is a shielding spell that manifests as a spherical barrier of indigo energy to defend against enemy attacks. This spell is a preferred defensive spell of both Zhalia Moon and Simon Judeau.\n\n== History ==\nDante cast a silent orange Armorbrand outside his house against Unnamed Suit 001's Augerfrost. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nZhalia used an indigo version of the spell during the battle against the Organization in the Cave of the Gargoyle. [S1E04]\n\nDante cast an orange Armorbrand to protect himself from Klaus' Poisonfang attack. [S1E17]\n\nUnnamed Suit 053 cast the spell over Hoffman in Tower of Nostradamus to protect him from the attacks of Melee Artist. [S2E28]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:S1E01 Dante Armorbrand.png|Dante silently casts an orange Armorbrand\nFile:S1E25 Zhalia Cherit Armorbrand.png|Zhalia uses Armorbrand\nFile:S2E28 Hoffman Armorbrand Melee Artist Billie.jpg|Armorbrand protects Hoffman from Melee Artist\nFile:S2E45 Tersly Armorbrand.png|Tersly uses Armorbrand\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E27_Dante_Armorbrand.jpg\n| aura  = Indigo\n| class = Protective\n| users = [[Dante Vale]]<br>[[Dr. Benway]]<br>[[Lok Lambert]]<br>[[Simon Judeau]]<br>[[Suits]]<br>[[Tersly]]<br>[[Wilder]]<br>[[Unnamed Suit 053]]<br>[[Zhalia Moon]]\n| first = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n}}'''Armorbrand''' is a shielding spell that manifests as a spherical barrier of indigo energy to defend against enemy attacks. This spell is a preferred defensive spell of both [[Zhalia Moon]] and [[Simon Judeau]].\n\n== History ==\nDante cast a silent orange Armorbrand outside his house against [[Unnamed Suit 001]]'s [[Augerfrost]]. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nZhalia used an indigo version of the spell during the battle against [[the Organization]] in the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]]. {{Source|S1E04}}\n\nDante cast an orange Armorbrand to protect himself from [[Klaus]]' [[Poisonfang]] attack. {{Source|S1E17}}\n\n[[Unnamed Suit 053]] cast the spell over [[Hoffman]] in [[Tower of Nostradamus]] to protect him from the attacks of [[Melee Artist]]. {{Source|S2E28}}\n{{clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:S1E01 Dante Armorbrand.png|Dante silently casts an orange Armorbrand\nFile:S1E25 Zhalia Cherit Armorbrand.png|Zhalia uses Armorbrand\nFile:S2E28 Hoffman Armorbrand Melee Artist Billie.jpg|Armorbrand protects [[Hoffman]] from [[Melee Artist]]\nFile:S2E45 Tersly Armorbrand.png|[[Tersly]] uses Armorbrand\n</gallery>\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR=Marque-armure\n|DUT=Vuurharnas”  “Spiegelschild\n|POR=Armadura\n}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Indigo-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation magic","Indigo-aura spells","Magic","Organization magic","Protective spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Dr. Benway","label":"Dr. Benway","target_id":"huntik:page:9054","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Benway","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A9054"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Simon Judeau","label":"Simon Judeau","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Simon_Judeau","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Tersly","label":"Tersly","target_id":"huntik:page:3210","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tersly","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3210"},{"target_title":"Wilder","label":"Wilder","target_id":"huntik:page:4467","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Wi